m $(9,3)$ to $(10,3.2),$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δx & =10-9=1, \\\\ Δy & =3.2-3=0.2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δf & ≈\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot 1-1\\cdot 0.2 \\\\  & ≈0.167-0.2 \\\\  & ≈-0.033.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis means that the value of $f$ decreases by about $0.033.$ Consequently, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(10,3.2) & ≈f(9,3)-0.033 \\\\ {e}^{\\sqrt{10}-3.2} & ≈{e}^{\\sqrt{9}-3}-0.033 \\\\  & ≈1-0.033 \\\\  & ≈0.967.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368264 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368265 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368266 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368267 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368268 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1041 "selection" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1104 #edb/ref 17592186368267 13194139535820 true] [17592186368263 1110 #uuid "6f5a2b81-bbba-529e-a955-bfdfbf250f11" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368264 1034 "0.970" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368264 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535820 true] [17592186368264 1111 #uuid "57684e9d-85c7-59b9-8ef0-89cb13180c82" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368265 1034 "0.961" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368265 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535820 true] [17592186368265 1111 #uuid "250506ea-7e20-54f3-b464-5b3d084ee5ca" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368266 1034 "0.972" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368266 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535820 true] [17592186368266 1111 #uuid "1d0ff7ae-f3ce-5c8c-91f2-b0f3762a9a31" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368267 1034 "0.967" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368267 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535820 true] [17592186368267 1111 #uuid "015b742d-9721-5eac-9912-f0fa084d193b" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368268 1034 "0.965" 13194139535820 true] [17592186368268 1103 #edb/ref 1759